"no_traffic_content" = "Check that listening and recording are enabled and that the client uses the correct port. The client must use the HTTP or SOCKS5 proxy; transparent capture requires a signed Network Extension build. Clear source selections, search filters and Hide Apple Traffic.\n\nSome clients manage their own network settings. Launch an isolated browser or terminal through Automation Dashboard, or verify with curl --proxy http://127.0.0.1:%ld <test-URL>. Upstream proxy and DNS rule matches appear in Connection Log.";
